### To approve

Add the {{ code .ApproveLabel }} label to this issue, or comment {{ .Approve }}. patchy then builds exactly the plan below: r{{ .Revision }}, `{{ .ShortDigest }}`. If this comment or the issue description is edited after patchy posted the plan, the approval is refused and patchy asks for a new plan.

For a different plan, say what should change in a comment, then re-apply the {{ code .TriggerLabel }} label or comment {{ .Replan }}. {{ .Cancel }} stops work on this intent.

